#: inc/class-rd-discord-widget.php:132
msgid ""
"Numeric <strong>Server ID</strong> (17-19 digits), not an invite code. Enable "
"Developer Mode in Discord, right-click the server icon → \"Copy Server ID\". "
"The server must also have Widget enabled in Server Settings → Widget."
